Section 7 — radio: runRadioBuild()
OLD_SECTION
if (hasLabel["status"]) {
    hasLabel["label"].style["min-height"] = radioDim[1];
    hasLabel["label"].classList.add("vRadioButtonLabel");
}

NEW_SECTION
if (hasLabel != null) {
    if (hasLabel["status"]) {
        hasLabel["label"].style["min-height"] = radioDim[1];
        hasLabel["label"].classList.add("vRadioButtonLabel");
    }
}

REASON
withLabel() returns null for an input with no sibling; the radio builder dereferenced
it unguarded (TypeError), while the checkbox builder already had this null check.

